        "body": "`divine-iac-coreconfig#364` is now closed, so this rollout issue appears unblocked on the infra prerequisite.\n\nSince `@dcadenas` is driving backend notification work, assigning this to him as the backend push DRI.\n\nSuggested closeout path from here:\n- confirm Terraform / GKE prereqs are applied in `poc`, `staging`, and `production`\n- deploy to `poc` and verify health, relay connectivity, and test push delivery\n- deploy to `staging` and repeat verification\n- deploy to `production` and monitor logs / health after rollout\n\nPlease use this issue thread to check off environment-by-environment rollout status so we have one place to track backend push readiness.\n\nRelated mobile-side work that depends on this landing cleanly:\n- divinevideo/divine-mobile#4207\n- divinevideo/divine-mobile#4387",
